.zig-cache/
zig-out/

# VM test harness (scripts/vm/): images are fetched on demand by
# scripts/vm/fetch-images.sh and customised by scripts/vm/provision.sh,
# never committed — the OpenWRT image alone is ~126 MB and would blow up repo
# size. images/ also holds the *provisioned* (locally derived) guests and the
# 41 MB OpenWRT ImageBuilder tarball; work/ holds the unpacked ImageBuilder
# tree (~530 MB) and the cross-compiled test binaries. All of it is
# reproducible from a fresh clone with `fetch-images.sh && provision.sh`.
# See scripts/vm/README.md.
scripts/vm/images/
scripts/vm/work/
